            </p>

            <ul>
              <li><strong>Zero Rust &amp; Corrosion:</strong> Aluminium naturally forms a protective oxide layer, making
                it completely impervious to rainwater, moisture, and sunlight.</li>
              <li><strong>Lightweight Operation:</strong> Puts 60% less strain on gate hinges and automation motors,
                ensuring decades of silent, smooth movement.</li>
              <li><strong>Contemporary Aesthetics:</strong> Available with sleek architectural slats, wood-sublimation
                finishes, and luxury rose gold pull handles.</li>
              <li><strong>Eco-Friendly &amp; Low Maintenance:</strong> Easy to clean with plain water and 100%
